  "description": "RAG (Retrieval Augmented Generation) orchestration for Mythosia.AI. Implements Mythosia.AI.Rag.Abstractions v6.x. Includes RagPipeline, text splitters, context builder, OpenAI/vLLM embedding providers, hybrid search (BM25 + Vector + RRF), re-ranking (Cohere, LLM, vLLM), Agentic RAG tool registration with per-call RagQueryOptions and structured search traces, search gate, keyword extraction, weighted-blend final selection, progress reporting, DoclingDocument-to-RagDocument conversion, and per-query VectorFilter passthrough (StoreFilter). Depends on Mythosia.AI.Abstractions (IAIService) instead of the full Mythosia.AI implementation.",
