  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v7.4.0-preview1: preview release for validating Agentic RAG per-call RagQueryOptions via WithAgenticRag(..., queryOptions: ...) and step-level AgenticRagSearchTrace via onTrace for references, diagnostics, candidates, and failure tracing.\n\nv7.3.2: recompiled for the Mythosia.AI v6.1.0 release line. No Mythosia.AI.Rag source, public API, or runtime behavior changes.\n\nv7.3.1: MarkdownTextSplitter — bold label propagation across all chunk boundaries, cascading split (paragraph → line → word), 50-char buffer margin, method renames (MergeBlocksIntoChunks, SplitOversizedBlock).",
